# Harness (ia-stories)

Before coding, read root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). Full design: [`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Gates before "done"

1. `npm run typecheck`
2. `npm run test`
3. `npm run test:e2e` if UI or API user-facing contract changed
4. Run the app and verify the claimed behaviour

Use `npm run ci` / `npm run ci:full` when in doubt. For prompt/RAG/model changes, run evals (`npm run eval` / `eval:ci`); do not rewrite `evals/baseline.json` without an intentional green review.

## Hard constraints

- Keep vanilla client + Vercel Functions — do not migrate this repo to React/Next.
- Keep three-zone guardrails (sanitize + fence retrieved context).
- Groq + `FORCE_LOCAL_EMBEDDINGS=1` is the production embedding story unless the user plans a provider/dim migration.
- Do not invent enterprise ops claims (OTel/AWS/K8s) that are not in the repo.
